"""Final list (25): Lynch story, PE/VC case, FY28 scenarios and evidence flags.

Tier A = the 15 council-reviewed finalists (scenarios from memo_content.MEMOS).
Tier B = Stage 3 ranks 16-25, desk-researched in Stage 4b (no council review).

Evidence flags drive the scenario probabilities (see projections.py and the
`projections` block in config.yaml). Negative flags move probability from bull
to bear; positive flags move it the other way.
  cfo_gap        CFO not verified for a recent full year
  weak_cash      CFO/PAT < 0.5 or negative recent CFO
  policy         earnings depend on an administered price, subsidy scheme or commodity price
  concentration  one customer, one country or one programme drives most revenue
  governance     SME listing, related-party exposure, pledge, promoter selling, audit qualification
  stalling       latest quarter or TTM shows growth slowing or reversing
  order_cover    order book >= 1.5x annual revenue (positive)
  cash_verified  CFO/PAT >= 0.8 on a verified recent year (positive)
  momentum       latest reported quarter grew profit > 25% YoY on a verified filing summary (positive)
"""

